      "instance_name": "anti_black_stereotype",
      "label": "Anti-Black Stereotype",
      "description": "The meme perpetuates a harmful anti-Black stereotype by implying that contemporary Black figures are somehow complicit in or responsible for historical slavery. This is a racist trope that falsely equates modern Black people with the historical institution of slavery, which is not accurate. The meme relies on the viewer's understanding of this stereotype to create its misleading narrative.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
