      "@type": "EmotionExpression",
      "instance_name": "condemnation",
      "label": "condemning emotion",
      "description": "The text 'morgan freeman condemning slavery' expresses a strong moral disapproval or condemnation of slavery. This emotion is conveyed through the misleading textual overlay, which falsely implies that Morgan Freeman is actively condemning slavery in the context of the image, when he is merely holding an award. The emotion is not expressed in the visual material itself but is imposed by the text to create a false narrative.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
